cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its result arrays, please cite the paper below."
title: "GONS — Geometric Open-set Null Space"
abstract: >-
  Official code and supplementary material for the ISPEC 2026 paper "GONS:
  Self-Calibrated Open-Set Rejection for Few-Shot Class-Incremental Intrusion
  Detection". GONS is a non-deep null-space classifier for open-set few-shot
  class-incremental network intrusion detection, with a rejection threshold read
  from its own calibration data under a finite-sample bound.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/troisang1/GONS"
