    affiliation: "University College Dublin, Dublin, Ireland"
    email: an.lekhac@ucd.ie
keywords:
  - network intrusion detection
  - open-set recognition
  - few-shot class-incremental learning
  - null-space methods
  - distribution-free guarantees
